how to define, broadcast, smj, and shj

broadcast- > df.join(broadcast(df2), seq("column_name"),"inner"))
smj -> for both dataframes, it will sort the data based on join key and then merge both the sorted records
--> df.hint("merge").join(df2.hint("merge"), seq("column_name"),"inner"))
shj -> for both dataframes, it will create a hash table of each partition, then look up matches from the other side.
--> df.hint("shuffle_hash").join(df2.hint("shuffle_hash"), seq("column_name"),"inner"))

